From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chad Cormier Roussel <chadcormierroussel@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 12:27:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] configure: Build dlls/lsteamclient, the Steam bridge.

Wine 11.19 has no lsteamclient, so Windows games' steam_api64.dll has
no client DLL that reaches Mac Steam's steamclient.dylib on the arm64
runtime. MacNeutron's build links Proton's lsteamclient/ folder (with
winecx's three Mac fixes) into the tree as dlls/lsteamclient, where
nothing builds it yet.

Register it in configure.ac and in the configure these patches carry,
as dlls/lz32 is, without running autoreconf (configure is committed,
as in the loader patch). The folder itself stays out of this patch: it
is Steamworks-SDK-derived source, fetched at build time.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 configure    | 2 ++
 configure.ac | 1 +
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configure b/configure
index 6b9a7809..57047e7f 100755
--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -1256,6 +1256,7 @@ enable_l3codecx_ax
 enable_loadperf
 enable_localspl
 enable_localui
+enable_lsteamclient
 enable_lz32
 enable_lzexpand
 enable_magnification
@@ -22258,6 +22259,7 @@ wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/localspl enable_localspl
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/localspl/tests enable_tests
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/localui enable_localui
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/localui/tests enable_tests
+wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/lsteamclient enable_lsteamclient
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/lz32 enable_lz32
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/lz32/tests enable_tests
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/lzexpand.dll16 enable_lzexpand
diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
index 0a888ce1..948c772e 100644
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -2790,6 +2790,7 @@ WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/localspl)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/localspl/tests)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/localui)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/localui/tests)
+WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/lsteamclient)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/lz32)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/lz32/tests)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/lzexpand.dll16)
-- 
